        "title": "About Russia Elections",
        "subject": "Russia Elections",
        "summary": "Russia’s 2026 parliamentary election chooses the ninth convocation of the State Duma, the elected lower chamber of the Federal Assembly. Voting is being held during Russia’s war against Ukraine and alongside regional and municipal elections; the political environment has been marked by restrictions on opposition activity.",
